{"id":"5ec66a9c4b71ae42","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Regular Borel Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure — ZFC Measure3 Regular Borel Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure","58-df-zfc-measure8-regular-borel-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure — ZFC Measure3 Regular Borel Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-regular-borel-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-regular-borel-measure — ZFC Measure3 Regular Borel Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Topology}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Topology}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelSigma}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelSigma}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8RegularBorelMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8RegularBorelMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Topology}_S(\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset,X\\in\\tau\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau)\\land\n\\forall U,V\\in\\tau\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Topology}_S(\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset,X\\in\\tau\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau)\\land\n\\forall U,V\\in\\tau\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\nK\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal F)\\land\nK\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal F)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}compact\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\nK\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal F)\\land\nK\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal F)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}sigma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorelSigma}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Topology}_S(\\tau,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\n\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal C,X)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal C\n\\to\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}sigma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorelSigma}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Topology}_S(\\tau,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\n\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal C,X)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal C\n\\to\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}regular\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BorelSigma}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\land\n\\mu(A)=\\sup\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}regular\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BorelSigma}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\land\n\\mu(A)=\\sup\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}regular\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8RegularBorelMeasure}_S(\\mu,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}regular\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8RegularBorelMeasure}_S(\\mu,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RegularBorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The locally defined compact-subset predicate has the exact signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K,X,\\tau)\">\\((K,X,\\tau)\\)</span> used by inner regularity.</li>\n<li>The measure8 regular-Borel-measure variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$, $\\mathrm{Measure}_S$, and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are as in [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]], [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]], and [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status"